  "ruleText": "Puc 2502.35 “Retire” means to make no further use of a certificate for purposes of trading in the generation attributes associated with the certificate.\n\nSource. #10741, eff 12-5-14 (from Puc 2502.32); ss by #12473, eff 2-1-18 (formerly Puc 2502.33)",
